{"id":610,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"They play with each other by knocking their large tusks together. Their tusks break sometimes, but they grow back so quickly that it isn’t a concern."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"These Pokémon nest in the ground and use their tusks to crush hard berries. Crushing berries is also how they test each other’s strength."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White"],"text":"They mark their territory by leaving gashes in trees with their tusks. If a tusk breaks, a new one grows in quickly."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Black"],"text":"They use their tusks to crush the berries they eat. Repeated regrowth makes their tusks strong and sharp."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Its large tusks have a tendency to break, but each time they grow back, they grow in harder and sturdier."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Rivalry","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's competitive spirit makes it deal more damage to Pokémon of the same gender, but less damage to Pokémon of the opposite gender."},{"name":"Mold Breaker","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unimpeded by the Ability of the target."},{"name":"Unnerve","hidden":true,"description":"Unnerves opposing Pokémon and makes them unable to eat Berries."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Dragon"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":40,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Green","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":610,"name":"Axew","condition":null,"children":[{"id":611,"name":"Fraxure","condition":"Lv. 38","children":[{"id":612,"name":"Haxorus","condition":"Lv. 48","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[3,44],[6,206],[9,372],[12,269],[15,163],[18,337],[21,184],[24,242],[27,349],[30,784],[33,116],[36,406],[39,14],[42,200],[45,12],[48,416]],"machine":[332,784,280,523,242,91,38,434,913,337,349,406,525,283,203,263,206,374,416,442,200,398,182,240,156,179,46,317,799,184,421,214,555,707,164,241,57,129,14,36,269,851,885,404],"egg